* cc2: loop gain/phase — series AC injection at op-amp output (upstream Rout=100R,
* downstream MOS gate ~infinite Z w/ 1G shunt path); T = -V(o1)/V(g)
.inc models.inc
V1 ta 0 3.3
Rtop ta t 10k
Rb t 0 150k
Rsamp t sn 120k
Rk1 sn x 2
Vsm x dd 0
M1 dd g b b nmosb
Rs b 0 150k
R1 vset ta 360k
R2 vset 0 200k
Rsh g 0 1g
Vinj o1 g 0 AC 1
Xop vset b ta 0 o1 opa333t
.ac dec 100 0.1 10meg
.end
